// Copy to Secrets.xcconfig — untracked, and included by Shared.xcconfig when it
// exists. The value must be one of the entries in the API's
// VIA_APP_CLIENT_KEYS; without it a build talking to a locked-down API is
// refused with 403 unknown_client on every route.
VIA_API_CLIENT_KEY = replace-with-the-shared-app-client-key
